    old "I don't wanna go to the farm! Please, Master, no!"
    new "我不想去农场！主人，求求您不要！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4996
    old "I don't want to be judgmental, but how can I not judge people whose favourite [thing] is [worst]? I just don't think we have anything in common!"
    new "我不想妄加评判，但如果有人最喜欢的东西是他们最讨厌的，我怎么能不评判他们呢？我觉得我们之间根本没有共同点！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4767
