#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:5192
    old "I doubt you care much about what's important to me, but I like [thing]."
    new "我怀疑你不太在意对我来说重要的东西，但我喜欢[东西]。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4450
    old "I enjoyed my time in [girl.origin]. But alas, a girl of my talents ought to attend the best of schools, which can only be found in big cities such as this."
    new "我在[girl.origin]过得很愉快。但是，唉，像我这样有才华的女孩应该去最好的学校读书，而这样的学校只有在大城市里才能找到。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4458
    old "I fail to see the funny side."
    new "我完全get不到笑点。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3964
    old "I feel like I could keel over at any moment. You're pushing me far beyond what my body and soul can take."
    new "我感觉自己随时都会倒下。你把我逼到了我的身心极限。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2717
    old "I feel like {i}someone{/i} is a little too sure of himself!"
