#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2390
    old "I feel so blessed to be with you."
    new "能和你在一起，我感到无比幸福。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4850
    old "I feel so hot! Please, take me now, Master! *grins*"
    new "我感觉好热！主人，请您现在就带走我吧！*咧嘴笑*"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4839
    old "I feel so warm ... must follow my instincts...to sin... and sin well..."
