    old "I feel terrible. I don't think I am up for this kind of work. I am sorry, Master... *sob*"
    new "我感觉糟透了。我觉得我胜任不了这种工作。对不起，主人……*抽泣*"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:831
    old "I feel terrible. I want out of here. Please, Master, don't leave me like this... *sob*"
    new "我感觉糟透了。我想离开这里。主人，求求您，不要就这样离开我……*啜泣*"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4446
    old "I figured as much."
    new "我猜也是这样。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1775
    old "I figured as much... Your words are hollow."
    new "我早就料到了……你的话毫无意义。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4107
    old "I find delight in many things. For instance, my favourite [thing] is [best]."
    new "我从很多事物中找到乐趣。例如，我最喜欢的就是[最好的]。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4989
    old "I find small talk a bit insincere."
    new "我觉得闲聊有点虚伪。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1704
    old "I find that hard to believe."
    new "我很难相信。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:5165
    old "I fucking hate it here! There's nothing all right about it."
    new "我他妈讨厌这里！这里没有一点好的地方。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4579
    old "I generally don't let free time interfere with my duties, but when I have the time I enjoy [hobby]."
    new "我一般不会让空闲时间干扰我的工作，但如果我有时间，我会享受[爱好]。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4583
    old "I generally try to be a good listener. I think everyone deserves to be heard. But if your jokes are not going to improve, I may have to walk away!"
    new "我一般都尽量做一个好的倾听者。我认为每个人都应该有发言权。但如果你的笑话没有改进的余地，我可能就不得不离开了！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4912
    old "I get so angry whenever someone doesn't give the [thing] [best] the respect it deserves."
    new "每当有人不给予[最好的东西]应有的尊重时，我都会非常生气。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2588
    old "I get the idea, but haven't tried it much myself. I'm curious about what it's like."
    new "我明白你的意思，但我自己没怎么尝试过。我很好奇那是什么感觉。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4911
    old "I get {i}very{/i} passionate when it comes to [hobby]."
