    old "I grew up near [girl.origin]."
    new "我在[girl.origin]附近长大。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1213
    old "I grew up next to a brothel in [girl.origin]."
    new "我在[girl.origin]长大，旁边就是一家妓院。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3398
    old "I grew up there with my [girl.story_guardian]. I remember how we used to cheer for the templars that came to fight unbelievers!"
