    old "I guess I'm a slave, so I have to do your bidding. Don't push me too hard, though."
    new "我想我算是奴隶了，所以只能听你使唤。不过，别逼我太狠。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3170
    old "I guess I'm just a pretty normal girl. I enjoy my life. I like doing things that I like. I like doing things my friends like too. That's pretty much it."
    new "我想我应该只是个很普通的女孩。我享受我的生活。我喜欢做自己喜欢的事。我也喜欢做朋友们喜欢的事。大概就是这样。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2989
