    new "我猜我现在有点兴奋……反正也该拿钱了。*咯咯笑* 我真是个荡妇！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2869
    old "I guess [thing] is all right or whatever."
    new "我想事情应该没问题吧。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4880
    old "I guess this is the goodbye, then... I hope I can find someone else, who will appreciate my services..."
    new "看来这就是告别了……我希望还能找到其他懂得欣赏我服务的人……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4881
    old "I guess this is the goodbye, then... I hope my new master will appreciate my services..."
    new "看来这就是告别了……希望我的新主人会感激我的效劳……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4814
    old "I guess us girls work with our bodies, so I should get in shape..."
    new "我想我们女生都是靠身体吃饭的，所以我应该保持身材……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2858
    old "I guess you can be like, a little scary and stuff."
    new "我觉得你可能有点吓人什么的。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1823
    old "I guess you could say we're friends... As long as they pay the fees."
    new "我想你可以说我们是朋友……只要他们支付费用就行。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3256
    old "I guess you don't really care about what I like and don't like... *frown*"
    new "看来你根本不在乎我喜欢什么不喜欢什么……*皱眉*"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2855
    old "I guess you're like, a decent guy or whatever."
