    old "I'm not like the other girls, so I'm well within my rights to receive some special treatment."
    new "我和其他女孩不一样，所以我完全有权利享受一些特殊待遇。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1924
    old "I'm not looking for your approval."
    new "我并不需要你的认可。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4989
    old "I'm not one for idle chit chat."
    new "我不爱闲聊。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4447
    old "I'm not one to gossip, but I heard something very peculiar..."
    new "我不是个爱八卦的人，但我听到了一些非常奇怪的事情……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4990
    old "I'm not one to gossip, but have you heard...?"
    new "我不是个爱八卦的人，但是你听说了吗……？"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2256
    old "I'm not really good at that sort of thing. Can we talk about something else?"
    new "我不太擅长这类事情。我们能聊点别的吗？"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2222
    old "I'm not really good at that sort of thing. Please be gentle..."
    new "我不太擅长这类事情，请您手下留情……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3055
    old "I'm not really that familiar with it, but it sounds like something I would enjoy."
    new "我对此不太了解，但听起来像是我会喜欢的东西。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4596
    old "I'm not so keen, but if you'd enjoy that, It wouldn't be fair to hold you back..."
    new "我不太热衷，但如果你喜欢，那我就不该阻止你了……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4481
    old "I'm not special, I think you're just a little slow. *laugh* But thank you nonetheless."
    new "我没什么特别的，我觉得你只是反应有点慢而已。（笑）不过还是谢谢你。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:5100
    old "I'm not sure about this, but for your sake I will do it."
    new "我对此并不确定，但为了你，我会这么做。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:5101
    old "I'm not sure about this... I'm not sure about it all. Let's not do it."
    new "我不太确定……我对所有事情都不确定。我们还是别做了。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4458
    old "I'm not sure if I should laugh or cry at that."
    new "我不知道该哭还是该笑。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3034
    old "I'm not sure what exactly you mean by that, but I think I'm getting addicted to the sound of your voice."
    new "我不太明白你的意思，但我好像有点迷上你的声音了。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1412
    old "I'm not that interested in most gifts. I do like [thing], though."
    new "我对大多数礼物都不太感兴趣。不过，我确实很喜欢[东西]。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2673
    old "I'm not, like, {i}that{/i} into [thing]s like [worst] actually."
    new "我其实不太喜欢那种糟糕的事情。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1955
    old "I'm off to class!"
    new "我要去上课了！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1954
    old "I'm off!"
    new "我走了！"
    # game/BKinit_variables.rpy:2040
    old "I'm offended that some of those upstarts at the League of Freethinkers are getting so rich, when so many of our own true blue-blooded nobles are facing ruin."
    new "我感到愤慨的是，自由思想家联盟中的一些暴发户变得如此富有，而我们自己的许多真正的蓝血贵族却面临破产。"

#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:5169
    old "I'm ok. Not happy, but not tearing down walls either."
    new "我没事。虽然不开心，但也没到要闹脾气的地步。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:834
    old "I'm okay, I guess."
    new "我没事吧。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4753
    old "I'm okay. I've been worse."
    new "我没事。我以前情况更糟。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2100
    old "I'm one of those girls who hates the [thing] [worst]."
    new "我是那种最讨厌[某某东西]的女孩之一。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1215
    old "I'm pretty sure everyone agrees that the best [thing] is [best]."
    new "我相信大家都会同意，最好的东西就是最好的。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2238
    old "I'm really good at that sort of thing. *blush* B-but talking to guys is still kind of scary to me."
    new "我真的很擅长这种事。*脸红* 但、但是和男生说话对我来说还是有点可怕。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1402
    old "I'm scared of what might happen when I displease you."
    new "我害怕惹你不高兴会发生什么事。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1520
    old "I'm single and ready to mingle. Can I see you tonight at [brothel.name]?"
    new "我单身，想找人约会。今晚能在[brothel.name]见到你吗？"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3422
    old "I'm so glad I'm yours. I'll never be this happy again."
    new "我真高兴我是你的。我再也不会这么开心了。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4588
    old "I'm so glad you want to hold my hand, [MC.name]."
    new "[MC.name]，我很高兴你想牵我的手。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:973
    old "I'm so horny... I get so wet when you watch me, Master... Aaaah..."
    new "我好想要……主人，你看着我的时候我都湿透了……啊……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2460
    old "I'm sorry Sill, it's not you..."
    new "对不起，希尔，不是你……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1317
    old "I'm sorry, I didn't mean it like that."
    new "对不起，我不是那个意思。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:696
    old "I'm sorry, I shouldn't have..."
    new "对不起，我不该那样……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4682
    old "I'm sorry, I will try harder next time..."
    new "对不起，下次我会更加努力……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:696
    old "I'm sorry, Master, I didn't mean..."
    new "对不起，主人，我不是故意的……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4682
    old "I'm sorry, Master, I disappointed you..."
    new "对不起，主人，我让您失望了……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1317
    old "I'm sorry, Master..."
    new "对不起，主人……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4069
    old "I'm sorry, [MC.name]. I am absolutely beat. I'll resume my duties as a {b}[girl.job]{/b} as soon as I am able."
    new "对不起，[MC.name]。我累坏了。我会尽快恢复我的{b}[girl.job]{/b}工作。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3331
    old "I'm sorry, but I have to get back to my duties. May Arios protect you."
    new "抱歉，我必须回去执行公务了。愿艾瑞俄斯保佑你。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3461
    old "I'm sorry, but I'm not brave enough yet. Make me a dirtier girl first."
    new "抱歉，我还没那么勇敢。先把我变成一个更放荡的女孩吧。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2210
    old "I'm sorry, but please don't joke about something like that."
    new "对不起，请不要拿这种事开玩笑。"
    # game/BKinit_variables.rpy:824
    old "I'm sorry, but you don't have enough gold..."
    new "对不起，你的黄金不够……"


    # game/BKinit_variables.rpy:832
    old "I'm sorry, but you don't seem to have enough money right now."
    new "对不起，但你现在似乎没有足够的钱。"

#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1240
    old "I'm sorry, that didn't really do it for me..."
    new "抱歉，这真的没能打动我……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1987
    old "I'm sorry, that's making me uncomfortable. Can we talk about something else?"
    new "抱歉，这让我感觉很不自在。我们能聊点别的吗？"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:699
    old "I'm sorry... *sob*"
    new "对不起……（抽泣）"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2926
    old "I'm sorry... I just don't swing that way, master..."
    new "抱歉……我真的不喜欢那种风格，主人……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1448
    old "I'm starting to pick up the pace now! *giggle* Or maybe I'm just getting sloppy and rushing it."
    new "我现在开始加快速度了！*咯咯笑* 或者也许我只是开始马虎，赶时间了。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1699
    old "I'm still good as new."
    new "我依然状态极佳。"#  game/BKscreens.rpy:4765
    old "I'm still working on that %s. You should come back later."
    new "我还在处理那个%s。你稍后再来吧。"
    # game/BKpostings.rpy:18
    old "I'm stranded here, drinking ale all day at the local inn. I'm bored out of my mind. Please send me some 'entertainment'."
    new "我被困在这里，整天在当地客栈喝麦酒。我无聊死了。请给我安排些“娱乐活动”。"

#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:5238
    old "I'm such a slut...thinking of [act_desc] all day. Do me now!"
    new "我真是个荡妇……整天都在想[act_desc]。现在就来操我！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2142
    old "I'm sure you have, but here's a little secret... I'm not like the others. *wink*"
    new "我知道你肯定知道，不过我告诉你个小秘密……我和其他人不一样。😉"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3458
    old "I'm sure you will be, once we start getting physical. There is plenty of time to make our dreams become a reality. Practice makes perfect!"
    new "我相信一旦我们开始进行体能训练，你就会明白的。我们有的是时间来实现我们的梦想。熟能生巧！"#  game/BKinit_variables.rpy:2208
    old "I'm telling you, she was a ninja! Who else could climb the {b}Prison{/b} walls like that?"
    new "我跟你说，她简直是个忍者！除了她，还有谁能像她那样爬上监狱的围墙？"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3972
    old "I'm terrified of what horrors you might subject me to next."
    new "我害怕你接下来会让我遭受怎样的折磨。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2966
    old "I'm totally drained right now... I'll return as a {b}[girl.job]{/b} as soon as I can."
    new "我现在筋疲力尽……我会尽快以{b}[girl.job]{/b}的身份回来。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4755
    old "I'm very happy here, Master! I really enjoy my work."
    new "主人，我在这里很开心！我真的很喜欢我的工作。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:836
    old "I'm very happy here, Master. There are very few things that I would change."
    new "主人，我在这里很开心，几乎没有什么需要改变的。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:176
    old "I'm waiting for my knight in shining armor, of course... *giggle*"
    new "我当然在等我的白马王子啦……*咯咯笑*"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4973
    old "I'm warning you, do not attempt to put a value on what we have here. It won't end well for the both of us."
    new "我警告你，不要试图给我们拥有的东西估价。否则对我们俩都没好处。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1852
    old "I'm your slave. Are we done here?"
    new "我是你的奴隶。我们结束了吗？"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3186
    old "I'm yours, [MC.name]."
    new "我是你的，[MC.name]。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2871
    old "I'm {i}really{/i} not, like, into [thing] actually."
    new "我其实对[东西]不太感兴趣。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2852
    old "I'm {i}so{/i} glad to hear that, master."
    new "听到这个消息我真是太高兴了，主人。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2672
    old "I'm, like, totally [best] type when it comes to [thing]!"
    new "我在这方面简直就是[最佳]类型！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2671
    old "I'm, like, totally the [hobby] type!"
    new "我简直就是那种[爱好]爱好者！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2868
    old "I'm, like, totally the [thing] type!"
    new "我简直就是那种[东西]类型！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1122
    old "I'm... Not ready for this."
    new "我……还没做好准备。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:679
    old "I'm... [girl.fullname]."
    new "我是……[女孩.全名]。"
    # game/BKinit_variables.rpy:2256
    old "I've been told of a secret swapping society in the King's Hold, where members exchange their wives and daughters in all-night orgies..."
    new "我听说国王的堡垒里有一个秘密的换妻社团，成员们通宵狂欢，交换妻子和女儿……"

#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3450
    old "I've been waiting for you. Saving myself for you."
    new "我一直在等你，一直为你守身如玉。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3405
    old "I've been whispering {i}notice me{/i} over and over again while I watch you from behind the bushes. It's worked. I'm [girl.fullname]."
    new "我躲在灌木丛后看着你，一遍又一遍地低声说着“注意到我”。这招奏效了。我是[girl.fullname]。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4260
    old "I've certainly had a lot of love. It's not my fault! Guys just seem to like me."
    new "我确实收到了很多爱。这可不是我的错！男生们似乎就是喜欢我。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1855
    old "I've come to know you very well."
    new "我已经非常了解你了。"
    # game/BKspells.rpy:88
    old "I've got magic in my pants. I mean, they make me run faster."
    new "我的裤子里有魔法。我的意思是，它们能让我跑得更快。"

#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1545
    old "I've got my roots in [girl.origin]."
    new "我的根源在[girl.origin]。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4110
    old "I've had more entertaining conversations with a horse."
    new "我跟马的对话都比这有趣。"
    # game/BKinit_variables.rpy:352
    old "I've heard a rumor about a secret Rank at the Slaver guild, higher even than Rank 'S'."
    new "我听说奴隶贩子公会里有一个秘密等级，甚至比“S”级还要高。"

#  game/BKinit_variables.rpy:2124
    old "I've heard of a fearsome group of superhuman stealth warriors, on a quest for blood and revenge throughout the city... They call them {i}ninjas{/i}."
    new "我听说有一群可怕的超人般的隐形战士，在城市里四处寻仇复仇……他们称自己为忍者。"
    # game/BKinit_variables.rpy:2043
    old "I've heard of a secret political organization called the Brotherhood. I have no idea who they are or what they do, but they're rumored to have enormous power in the city."
    new "我听说过一个名为“兄弟会”的秘密政治组织。我不知道他们是谁，也不知道他们做什么，但据说他们在城里拥有巨大的权力。"


    # game/BKinit_variables.rpy:386
    old "I've heard of something called 'NewGame+' if you reach the end of the game. Whatever could that mean?"
    new "我听说过一种叫做“新游戏+”的东西，如果你通关了的话。那是什么意思呢？"

#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:169
    old "I've heard some interesting news..."
    new "我听到了一些有趣的消息……"
    # game/BKinit_variables.rpy:2105
    old "I've heard some talk of a secret lair somewhere around the Slums... A haven for thieves and bandits. I shiver to think of it."
    new "我听说贫民窟附近有个秘密巢穴……那是盗贼和强盗的避风港。一想到就让我不寒而栗。"

#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4831
    old "I've learned to love it up the back door, Master! *wink*"
    new "我已经学会享受从后门进入的感觉了，主人！😉"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3232
    old "I've never seen this much money! Really, thank you from the bottom of my heart! Thank you, [MC.name]!"
    new "我从来没见过这么多钱！真的，由衷地感谢你！谢谢你，[MC.name]！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:882
    old "I've noticed that I'm interested in [act_desc]... Do you think it's wrong?"
    new "我注意到我对[act_desc]很感兴趣……你觉得这样不对吗？"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:5006
    old "I've noticed you like my breasts. *smiles*"
    new "我注意到你喜欢我的胸部。*微笑*"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4448
    old "I've often wondered if the body is a meat prison that humanity will one day abandon, don't you think so?"
    new "我常常在想，身体是不是人类终有一天会抛弃的肉体牢笼，你不觉得吗？"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4583
    old "I've probably heard worse jokes, but can't think of any right now..."
    new "我可能听过更糟糕的笑话，但现在想不起来有什么……"
    # game/BKinit_variables.rpy:2027
    old "I've seen an incredible fight at the arena! Cyntia's a slave, but she's got style."
    new "我在竞技场上看到了一场精彩绝伦的战斗！辛西娅虽然是奴隶，但她很有型。"

#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3666
    old "I've sent in a proposal to the city council to expel anyone who doesn't like [hobby]."
    new "我已经向市议会提交了一份提案，要求驱逐任何不喜欢[爱好]的人。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4613
    old "I've slept with several men before you. It just feels like the right thing to do, if a guy really wants it and finds me attractive. Like you do now..."
    new "在你之前，我已经和好几个男人睡过了。如果一个男人真的想要，而且觉得我很有魅力，那我觉得这么做是对的。就像你现在这样……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3273
    old "I've sometimes talked about this with the other girls. Once one of them said they like [worst]. I didn't tell her, but I just didn't see the point..."
    new "我有时会和其他女生聊起这个。有一次，其中一个女生说她最不喜欢[最讨厌]。我没跟她说，但我觉得没必要……"
    # game/BKspells.rpy:48
    old "I've spent months living among the amazon tribes of the Lankan Rainforest. Wanna know how they do it?"
    new "我在兰卡雨林的亚马逊部落中生活了几个月。想知道他们是怎么做到的吗？"

#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1696
    old "I've tried a few things."
    new "我尝试了一些方法。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1695
    old "I've tried lots of things with lots of different men."
    new "我跟很多不同的男人尝试过很多事情。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3446
    old "I've tried my best. I know you appreciate girls with experience, so I have been putting in the effort for you."
    new "我已经尽力了。我知道你欣赏有经验的女孩，所以我一直在为你努力。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2001
    old "I, erm... I'm not afraid to say I imagined us doing this together. *blush*"
    new "我，呃……我不怕承认，我幻想过我们一起做这件事。*脸红*"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1814
    old "I-I can't rightly say... It doesn't seem real to me."
    new "我无法断言……我觉得这不太真实。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4506
    old "I-I do. I'd be ashamed if I left any branch of knowledge unexplored, sensuality included."
    new "是的。如果我对任何知识领域都未曾探索过，包括感官方面，我都会感到羞愧。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2335
    old "I-I don't deserve such kindness, master."
    new "主人，我不配得到您这样的恩惠。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4487
    old "I-I have had a partner, but... Things did not go very well."
    new "我曾有过伴侣，但是……事情进展得不太顺利。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2334
    old "I-I understand, master. I'll do as I'm told."
    new "我明白了，主人。我会照您吩咐的做。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2300
    old "I-I understand... [girl.fullname]. I'll do as I'm told."
    new "我明白了……[女孩全名]。我会照你说的做。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3463
    old "I-I want to, but... I've never done anything like that, so I think I'm too scared..."
    new "我很想去，但是……我从来没做过这种事，所以我想我太害怕了……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4502
    old "I-I'm human, just like everyone else. S-Stop smirking at me, you jerk!"
    new "我也是人，跟其他人一样。别再对我露出那种傻笑了，你这个混蛋！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4503
    old "I-I'm not saying no, but you really need to learn how to lead up to these things. Think about it from my perspective."
    new "我不是说不行，但你真的需要学习如何循序渐进地推进这些事情。试着从我的角度想想。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4312
    old "I-I'm not so sure what to think... What's your opinion, [MC.name]?"
    new "我不太确定该怎么想……你觉得呢，[MC.name]？"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:702
    old "I-I'm not sure about this..."
    new "我对此不太确定……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:2425
    old "I-I'm not sure if I can do that...."
    new "我不确定我能不能做到……"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4330
    old "I-I'm sorry [MC.name], I can't... Please give me some more time."
    new "对不起[MC.name]，我不能……请再给我一些时间。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:1463
    old "I-I'm sorry, Master... This is all new to me. I'm very nervous."
    new "对不起，主人……这一切对我来说都是全新的。我很紧张。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4504
    old "I-I'm speaking in general terms, understand? Y-Yes, I believe most—if not all—girls do."
    new "我只是泛泛而谈，明白吗？是的，我相信大多数女孩——如果不是全部的话——都会这样。"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:4708
    old "I-I-I understand ... I will not let you down, Master"
