    old "g: The Blood Islands are a rugged but beautiful place. I remember believing as a child that the natural colour of sea was deep crimson, because that's what it looked like, where I grew up with my [girl.story_guardian]!"
    new "g：血岛是一个崎岖但美丽的地方。我记得小时候一直以为大海的自然颜色是深红色，因为我和我的[girl.story_guardian]一起长大的地方，大海看起来就是这个颜色！"#  game/BKdialogue.rpy:3743
    old "g: The Carpenters Guild? Oh yeah... I did tell you that. *laughs*"
